{!<span class="tooltip-text faction-text f-offensive" title="Later led by Ruth Fischer and Arkadi Maslow. Armed action soon: the theory of the offensive.">Left</span>!}: [+ offensive_strength : strength +], [+ offensive_satisfaction : satisfaction +]

